alue":"4"}]},{"expected":"Save draft","explanation":"Submitting now would start a review before the requester’s intended draft check. Save the complete draft and keep submission separate.","id":"operation","label":"Draft action","options":[{"label":"Save draft","value":"Save draft"},{"label":"Submit for approval","value":"Submit for approval"}]}],"fixtureRevision":"1","format":"revealline-learning-lesson.v1","id":"coupa-product-operations-02-lesson","kind":"practice","missionId":"coupa-product-operations-02","notice":"Fictional, offline training. Illustrative records; no live Coupa actions or certification.","records":[{"id":"draft","lines":["Item: desk lamp. Quantity: empty. Currency: EUR.","Delivery address is now Workshop North."],"title":"Draft R-301"},{"id":"brief","lines":["The team needs 4 desk lamps.","The requester wants to save the draft for review before submission."],"title":"Request note"}],"revision":"3","role":"Requester","sourceReviewedAt":"2026-09-26","sources":[{"title":"Coupa Core API — Requisitions","url":"https://docs.coupa.com/en/developer-documentation/the-coupa-core-api/resources/transactional-resources/requisitions-api-requisitions"}],"success":"R-301 saved as a complete draft. It has not been submitted.","title":"Repair and save the draft"},{"brief":"Apply the stated policy to a fictional request. The training screen is illustrative, not a replica of a customer instance.","campaignId":"coupa-product-operations","fields":[{"expected":"Return for clarification","explanation":"780 credits exceeds this case’s threshold and the required quote is absent. Approval would bypass the stated evidence check.","id":"decision","label":"Review action","options":[{"label":"Return for clarification","value":"Return for clarification"},{"label":"Approve","value":"Approve"}]},{"expected":"Attach supporting quote","explanation":"A request to attach the quote tells the requester how to repair the handoff. An age complaint does not identify the missing evidence.